WEBVTT

00:00:36.930 --> 00:00:39.160
Tea!

00:00:42.040 --> 00:00:43.770
There's nobody here!

00:00:44.040 --> 00:00:47.030
They're all worthless...

00:00:51.250 --> 00:00:52.540
What's this?

00:01:01.920 --> 00:01:04.320
What the hell's going on?!

00:01:28.620 --> 00:01:31.020
Is the Jill Tree to your liking?

00:01:31.150 --> 00:01:36.110
The lust of 10,000 women
will bring you new power.

00:01:38.830 --> 00:01:43.790
Are you trying to say that you're
granting me such power, Black?

00:01:44.100 --> 00:01:48.430
N-Not at all...
It is merely my d-duty to you.

00:01:51.310 --> 00:01:53.640
Stay out of it?
What are you talking about?!

00:01:53.640 --> 00:01:56.270
It was decided at an
emergency cabinet meeting.

00:01:56.280 --> 00:02:00.370
There are 10,000 hostages. Do you
think we can go in and act recklessly?

00:02:00.380 --> 00:02:04.370
Exactly! We should be thinking
about the well-being of those hostages!

00:02:04.390 --> 00:02:06.150
This is an order!

00:02:06.150 --> 00:02:08.520
Just leave the rest up to the owner.

00:02:08.520 --> 00:02:10.250
That owner?

00:02:10.260 --> 00:02:14.090
Don't even think about trying anything!
You're a police officer.

00:02:14.160 --> 00:02:16.860
Your duty is to follow orders!

00:02:23.540 --> 00:02:25.370
Honey Kisaragi.

00:02:29.110 --> 00:02:32.880
You do not belong near the Jill Tree.

00:02:32.980 --> 00:02:38.040
Panther Claw! Release those
10,000 women at once! Or else—

00:02:38.050 --> 00:02:41.420
Or else what, Cutie Honey?

00:02:41.420 --> 00:02:44.790
You'll have to defeat me
to go any further!

00:02:44.790 --> 00:02:46.350
Then I will defeat you!

00:02:48.200 --> 00:02:51.560
Honey Flash!

00:03:03.550 --> 00:03:07.310
So this is the power of Prototype Jill...
It is immense.

00:03:07.320 --> 00:03:11.810
Its implementation has instantly
changed the nature of war.

00:03:11.820 --> 00:03:14.690
It's a good thing that it went out
of control in this country.

00:03:14.790 --> 00:03:19.850
If these people are told to stay out of it,
they'll simply obediently wag their tails.

00:03:20.330 --> 00:03:23.260
Of course, we do wish to protect them, too.

00:03:23.260 --> 00:03:24.500
What are our orders for the assault?

00:03:24.500 --> 00:03:24.870
US Navy 7th Fleet, George W. Bush

00:03:24.870 --> 00:03:27.870
Don't make a move yet. Agent Blue says he has something urgent to discuss.

00:03:27.870 --> 00:03:29.200
Combat Direction Center

00:03:29.200 --> 00:03:29.670
Don't make a move yet. Agent Blue says he has something urgent to discuss.

00:03:29.670 --> 00:03:34.410
We have prepared our final trump card.
It won't hurt to give it a little time.

00:03:34.410 --> 00:03:38.710
Cutie Honey,
Professor Kisaragi's ultimate legacy...

00:03:41.780 --> 00:03:43.980
You'll have to do better than this!

00:03:55.300 --> 00:03:56.960
Got you!

00:03:59.430 --> 00:04:01.530
Persistent little bitch!

00:04:07.980 --> 00:04:10.210
Honey Tornado!

00:04:10.680 --> 00:04:13.910
Ah, so you can block my attack?

00:04:13.920 --> 00:04:18.940
But I can transform the energy
of my exquisitely beautiful voice into...

00:04:18.950 --> 00:04:21.110
...a super deadly supersonic
sound wave beam!

00:04:21.120 --> 00:04:24.990
How long can you
withstand my Black Beam?

00:04:24.990 --> 00:04:27.190
Such radiance. Such beauty.

00:04:27.200 --> 00:04:28.390
Such power!

00:04:28.600 --> 00:04:32.050
This truly is power that
should rightly be in my hands!

00:04:32.070 --> 00:04:35.330
But have I seen this before?

00:04:35.340 --> 00:04:37.000
Something so familiar...

00:04:37.570 --> 00:04:39.970
Just what is this feeling?

00:04:41.580 --> 00:04:45.640
"Create a new world. "
That was the first voice I heard.

00:04:45.650 --> 00:04:50.680
Under that command,
I developed, and my desire grew...

00:04:50.690 --> 00:04:53.450
Hey, she's looking this way.
You thinks she understands?

00:04:53.450 --> 00:04:55.790
Emergency situation.

00:04:55.790 --> 00:04:57.780
Level 5 has been contaminated.

00:04:57.790 --> 00:05:00.320
Ship's classification confirmed.
But something is wrong!

00:05:00.330 --> 00:05:02.420
The nanomachines aren't responding!

00:05:02.430 --> 00:05:06.230
Initiate emergency stop! An outbreak
must be prevented at all costs!

00:05:06.630 --> 00:05:09.260
It's no good!
Processes aren't terminating!

00:05:09.270 --> 00:05:13.970
Never mind! Inject the anti-nanomachines
and return the Ai-System to its base state!

00:05:13.980 --> 00:05:17.930
I'm trying! But something is breaking down
the serum and causing them to restart!

00:05:17.950 --> 00:05:20.280
What's causing this?
Where did a program like that come from?

00:05:20.280 --> 00:05:26.050
Critical warning.
Level 2 has been contaminated.

00:05:26.050 --> 00:05:28.650
The lab is going to be destroyed!
Evacuate immediately!

00:05:28.660 --> 00:05:31.020
I repeat, evacuate immediately!

00:05:34.860 --> 00:05:37.850
But still, no one showed any joy...

00:05:38.030 --> 00:05:39.900
There was no celebration.

00:05:40.940 --> 00:05:44.340
What is this? What is that?
Who is that?

00:05:45.010 --> 00:05:47.800
She'll be able to tell me.

00:05:54.380 --> 00:05:57.480
Jill-sama is crying again...

00:05:57.490 --> 00:06:00.780
It's your fault!
Because of you, Jill-sama's heart...

00:06:00.790 --> 00:06:03.520
I really wish you wouldn't
put the blame on me.

00:06:04.990 --> 00:06:08.120
This is bad...
I'm using up all my energy.

00:06:08.130 --> 00:06:11.060
Well, I think it's about
time to finish you off.

00:06:11.230 --> 00:06:13.860
One octave up version!

00:06:24.610 --> 00:06:28.450
My, it's quite impressive that you
managed to survive that energy...

00:06:28.450 --> 00:06:32.110
Very well, this time I'll give you
the three octave up version.

00:06:32.190 --> 00:06:34.250
And with that, I will have you gone!

00:06:34.260 --> 00:06:35.980
Ready, go!

00:06:40.090 --> 00:06:41.290
What the?!

00:06:46.930 --> 00:06:48.990
What are you doing, Honey?

00:06:52.340 --> 00:06:53.470
Na-chan!

00:06:53.470 --> 00:06:55.640
Sneaking off to fight on your own
was pretty selfish, wasn't it?

00:06:55.640 --> 00:06:58.670
But, is this really okay?
The police have evacuated, haven't they?

00:06:58.680 --> 00:07:02.910
— You knew?
— That's why I thought I had no choice but to do it alone.

00:07:02.920 --> 00:07:05.150
I couldn't keep relying on you, Na-chan!

00:07:05.150 --> 00:07:06.380
Don't be silly.

00:07:06.390 --> 00:07:09.480
Anyway, how did you get
a hold of something like that?

00:07:09.490 --> 00:07:11.120
Oh, that?

00:07:11.130 --> 00:07:15.590
I just sort of borrowed it,
but it looks like it's out of ammo already.

00:07:15.600 --> 00:07:20.330
Anyway, more than that...
It looks like what you need is some onigiri.

00:07:23.770 --> 00:07:28.970
So, is this what they mean by
"the beauty of womanly love"?

00:07:32.880 --> 00:07:34.210
You beast!

00:07:36.320 --> 00:07:37.550
Away with you!

00:07:38.690 --> 00:07:39.850
Na-chan!

00:07:40.090 --> 00:07:41.210
Stop it!

00:07:41.220 --> 00:07:47.220
A mere human calling this beautiful
Black Claw a beast is extremely insolent.

00:07:47.230 --> 00:07:51.290
After I clean up Cutie Honey,
you will be thoroughly punished.

00:07:51.470 --> 00:07:53.530
I wonder who'll be the one to be cleaned up?

00:07:53.730 --> 00:07:55.460
This one just doesn't know when to shut up, does she?

00:07:55.470 --> 00:07:57.870
No! Don't lay a finger on Na-chan!

00:07:57.870 --> 00:08:02.000
Honey, I continued to sacrifice
everything for Jill-sama's sake.

00:08:02.080 --> 00:08:05.510
I have done everything
to try to make her happy.

00:08:05.510 --> 00:08:09.350
And yet... why, why won't Jill-sama smile for me?

00:08:09.350 --> 00:08:11.180
I don't know what to tell you...

00:08:11.190 --> 00:08:13.090
It's your own fault, isn't it?

00:08:13.090 --> 00:08:15.450
Well, I'm not concerned about that any more.

00:08:15.460 --> 00:08:18.650
I'll just turn your head over to Jill-sama!

00:08:22.960 --> 00:08:25.690
Black Tornado!

00:08:28.440 --> 00:08:31.300
I'll cut you to shreds!

00:08:41.020 --> 00:08:43.310
What the hell is going on in there?

00:08:43.320 --> 00:08:47.250
It's surprising that you still have so much power.

00:08:50.930 --> 00:08:54.120
However, it looks like that energy is about to run out.

00:08:54.400 --> 00:08:56.800
I'll send you to meet that father of yours!

00:08:56.800 --> 00:08:58.030
Papa?

00:08:58.030 --> 00:09:02.160
That's right!
I was the one who killed Professor Kisaragi!

00:09:10.440 --> 00:09:12.910
What do you think you're doing?
G-Get your hands off me!

00:09:28.830 --> 00:09:31.320
My dear Honey...

00:09:41.310 --> 00:09:43.440
It looks like you remember.

00:09:43.610 --> 00:09:48.980
You... You're the one...
You killed papa!!

00:09:48.980 --> 00:09:51.250
That's right, I killed him.

00:09:51.250 --> 00:09:53.550
Me, in all my beauty!

00:09:55.360 --> 00:09:57.290
— Unforgivable!
— Amusing...

00:09:57.290 --> 00:10:00.490
I will defeat you for Jill-sama's sake.

00:10:00.630 --> 00:10:04.560
You!!!
You're the one who will pay for this!

00:10:08.200 --> 00:10:10.260
W-What is this light?

00:10:12.010 --> 00:10:14.270
What is it this time?!

00:10:16.410 --> 00:10:19.310
What? I'm being pushed back...

00:10:19.310 --> 00:10:22.280
Where was she hiding that power?

00:10:22.280 --> 00:10:27.220
This isn't good...
The Black Body alone can't face such power.

00:10:27.220 --> 00:10:29.050
Black Saw!

00:10:29.160 --> 00:10:31.180
Black Face On!

00:10:32.230 --> 00:10:35.090
Hyper turbo change!

00:10:44.010 --> 00:10:45.500
You're mine!

00:10:50.880 --> 00:10:54.180
This is vengeance... for my father!

00:11:03.260 --> 00:11:05.560
J-Jill-sama...

00:11:13.000 --> 00:11:14.130
Honey!

00:11:18.210 --> 00:11:19.600
Sister...

00:11:21.210 --> 00:11:22.640
My brother...

00:11:22.680 --> 00:11:25.700
Even though our bodies have been separated...

00:11:25.710 --> 00:11:27.080
our...

00:11:27.080 --> 00:11:28.640
wishes...

00:11:29.220 --> 00:11:30.710
are one.

00:11:31.890 --> 00:11:34.250
You did it. Honey?

00:11:37.890 --> 00:11:39.380
I want her.

00:11:39.890 --> 00:11:41.660
What she has...

00:11:41.860 --> 00:11:44.760
I want it, too. And I'll have it.

00:11:47.000 --> 00:11:48.530
What the hell is this?!

00:11:48.540 --> 00:11:50.160
And what are you doing? Move!

00:11:51.810 --> 00:11:55.040
Can't you help out a little?

00:11:55.040 --> 00:11:56.100
Sorry!

00:12:02.520 --> 00:12:04.750
This way! Over here!

00:12:04.890 --> 00:12:07.050
Hey, hey, look! Over here!

00:12:07.050 --> 00:12:08.820
What is it now?!

00:12:09.090 --> 00:12:11.390
That's the voice of the Granny from the office...

00:12:11.390 --> 00:12:15.850
I don't know who that is but if she's someone you know, then she must be on our side.

00:12:15.860 --> 00:12:16.960
Okay!

00:12:20.470 --> 00:12:23.700
It appears the second type
you love so much has retreated.

00:12:23.700 --> 00:12:27.040
The defeat of another of the Four was something to behold, but this is as far as she gets.

00:12:27.040 --> 00:12:30.070
Don't get ahead of yourself.
We don't know that yet.

00:12:31.510 --> 00:12:34.410
She's based on human cells.

00:12:34.450 --> 00:12:36.610
There is a limit to the amount of time she can remain active.

00:12:36.620 --> 00:12:38.780
Even with the nanomachines,
she's limited?

00:12:38.790 --> 00:12:41.850
So you're saying her design was a failure?

00:12:43.060 --> 00:12:44.350
Na-chan...

00:12:44.930 --> 00:12:46.150
What?

00:12:46.960 --> 00:12:49.490
What is it?

00:12:51.070 --> 00:12:52.400
Thank you.

00:12:53.100 --> 00:12:55.970
Not at all. She can grow!

00:12:55.970 --> 00:12:57.600
Just like a human.

00:12:57.610 --> 00:13:00.800
That's why it still may be possible
to bring Prototype Jill under control.

00:13:00.810 --> 00:13:04.180
— You're just dreaming.
— It's a dream...

00:13:04.380 --> 00:13:08.250
It's a dream that such a genius
professor like Kisaragi has existed.

00:13:08.250 --> 00:13:12.580
On one hand, it's like a nightmare...
But on the other, there is hope.

00:13:13.650 --> 00:13:14.950
Honey...

00:13:15.660 --> 00:13:17.180
Cutie Honey...

00:13:18.860 --> 00:13:20.720
I want you.

00:13:25.450 --> 00:13:27.160
Counter-measure Headquarters
National Police Agency Provisional Office

00:13:27.170 --> 00:13:29.360
The government has issued an evacuation order.

00:13:29.370 --> 00:13:31.300
They said to get everyone out of Tokyo.

00:13:31.310 --> 00:13:32.700
Hm? Oh, ok.

00:13:32.710 --> 00:13:37.040
Aren't you listening?
Everyone at headquarters has already fled!

00:13:39.350 --> 00:13:39.590
I see now. This is a prelude to disaster.

00:13:39.590 --> 00:13:42.800
Letter of Resignation
I see now. This is a prelude to disaster.

00:13:42.800 --> 00:13:42.810
I see now. This is a prelude to disaster.

00:13:42.980 --> 00:13:45.950
— A resignation?
— It's Detective Aki's.

00:13:45.950 --> 00:13:48.790
— What? The detective's?
— Can you believe it?

00:13:48.790 --> 00:13:53.230
But she's someone who would take on and arrest even aliens for the sake of upholding the law!

00:13:53.230 --> 00:13:56.890
Well, there are some who would say good riddance.

00:13:56.900 --> 00:13:58.830
I guess she finally had enough...

00:13:58.830 --> 00:14:00.130
Possibly.

00:14:00.270 --> 00:14:03.360
But one thing I can say for sure is that she hasn't given up.

00:14:03.870 --> 00:14:07.270
She left her badge but her pistol was nowhere to be found.

00:14:07.270 --> 00:14:10.900
On top of that, a grenade launcher was taken from the confiscation room.

00:14:10.910 --> 00:14:14.610
— She's crazy.
— Idiot! She's the one thinking clearly.

00:14:14.620 --> 00:14:16.810
— That's it, let's go!
— Where are we going?

00:14:16.820 --> 00:14:18.310
We're the leadership of the populous.

00:14:18.320 --> 00:14:21.450
I have my doubts that everyone
has been informed of the evacuation.

00:14:21.460 --> 00:14:24.450
— But...
— We have our own road to follow.

00:14:24.460 --> 00:14:26.760
We have to do what we can.

00:14:51.790 --> 00:14:54.580
How long do you plan to stay in there?

00:14:55.390 --> 00:14:58.190
You ate dinner, didn't you?
Come one, let's go!

00:15:01.230 --> 00:15:02.890
I have to go, don't I?

00:15:03.160 --> 00:15:05.530
Na-chan, I'm scared.

00:15:06.530 --> 00:15:09.830
When I get angry, I don't even
know who I am any more.

00:15:09.940 --> 00:15:13.530
I thought I had finally gotten used to it, but it seems like I'm still not ready to deal with it.

00:15:13.540 --> 00:15:14.510
Honey...

00:15:14.510 --> 00:15:17.910
"Neither a god nor a devil, just live as a human."

00:15:18.150 --> 00:15:20.380
My father told me that.

00:15:20.480 --> 00:15:24.280
But going on like this,
I feel my humanity slipping away.

00:15:24.990 --> 00:15:29.080
Na-chan and Seiji-kun...
I finally have friends.

00:15:29.260 --> 00:15:31.380
But now, I...

00:15:35.130 --> 00:15:39.230
Honey... I don't want to lose you.

00:15:39.470 --> 00:15:41.800
I don't want to lose another friend!

00:16:04.830 --> 00:16:08.350
I don't ever want to lose another friend again.

00:16:08.460 --> 00:16:11.230
That's why until today I've done everything alone.

00:16:11.230 --> 00:16:12.360
Na-chan.

00:16:12.370 --> 00:16:14.530
You suddenly appeared, you moved in next door,

00:16:14.540 --> 00:16:16.200
and you got involved in this case.

00:16:16.200 --> 00:16:18.190
And I didn't ask for any of it!

00:16:19.070 --> 00:16:20.540
I'm sorry...

00:16:20.540 --> 00:16:22.810
I didn't ever want to make another friend.

00:16:22.880 --> 00:16:24.810
But you showed up and had to become my friend.

00:16:26.350 --> 00:16:30.280
Promise me... Promise you won't die!
An android can do that, can't it?

00:16:30.280 --> 00:16:32.450
— I'll try—
— "I'll try" is not good enough!

00:16:32.450 --> 00:16:34.110
Promise me.

00:16:34.920 --> 00:16:37.480
Promise we'll come back together.

00:16:37.490 --> 00:16:40.890
— Na-chan! Do you mean you...
— Don't make me say it.

00:16:40.890 --> 00:16:42.520
Thank you, Na-chan!

00:16:43.630 --> 00:16:47.530
I'm not alone any more!
We really are friends, aren't we?

00:16:47.530 --> 00:16:49.530
Get your hands off of me!

00:16:49.540 --> 00:16:51.600
Na-chan, I love you!

00:16:51.610 --> 00:16:54.340
— Stop hugging me!
— But I'm so happy!

00:16:54.340 --> 00:16:56.330
First, let's do what we can.

00:16:56.340 --> 00:16:58.640
You're the only one who can fight these guys.

00:16:58.650 --> 00:16:59.170
Okay!

00:16:59.170 --> 00:17:01.310
So hurry and get yourself cleaned up
then let's get back out there.

00:17:01.320 --> 00:17:03.440
— Okay!
— It's a promise. Right, partner?

00:17:03.450 --> 00:17:04.540
Gotcha!

00:17:04.550 --> 00:17:07.380
Sorry to interrupt such
a tender moment, but...

00:17:08.290 --> 00:17:10.120
You can't go out there naked.

00:17:15.840 --> 00:17:18.600
US Navy Nuclear Ballistic Missile Submarine
Seahawk

00:17:32.850 --> 00:17:36.410
The Imaginary Induction System, or "Ai-System",

00:17:36.520 --> 00:17:40.680
disassembles matter at the subatomic level, then reconstructs it as a collection nanomachines.

00:17:40.690 --> 00:17:44.680
Send it into battle once and, because it propagates infinitely, there is no concern about supplies.

00:17:44.690 --> 00:17:46.890
It's the ultimate weapon.

00:17:46.890 --> 00:17:49.660
That is, of course, if you can keep it under control.

00:17:56.670 --> 00:17:59.660
Finally we meet, Sister Jill.

00:18:00.040 --> 00:18:03.240
I've been looking forward
to this, Cutie Honey.

00:18:03.710 --> 00:18:06.240
I guess I'm supposed to say,
"Nice to meet you."

00:18:06.410 --> 00:18:09.870
Jill... If it weren't for you, my father...

00:18:09.880 --> 00:18:12.040
That's not quite true.

00:18:20.330 --> 00:18:21.760
What...

00:18:22.800 --> 00:18:24.990
Father, why would you...

00:18:25.000 --> 00:18:30.300
Both you and I were born to be of use to Jill-sama, Honey.

00:18:32.970 --> 00:18:36.200
Me... and father... for Jill?

00:18:36.210 --> 00:18:38.770
Don't be mislead!
Stay strong, Honey!

00:18:39.210 --> 00:18:42.210
No... No, it can't be!

00:18:42.220 --> 00:18:44.710
Don't misunderstand.
To be more precise,

00:18:44.720 --> 00:18:48.090
We are part of Jill. We're family.

00:18:48.520 --> 00:18:52.960
The first implementation of the AI-System was in Prototype Jill.

00:18:53.230 --> 00:18:55.420
However, Jill was a failure.

00:18:55.860 --> 00:18:58.730
Jill-sama was lacking something very important—

00:18:58.730 --> 00:19:01.720
a human heart. Poor Jill...

00:19:01.740 --> 00:19:05.870
Having the power of a god, yet unfit to be a creator.

00:19:05.870 --> 00:19:08.810
Repeatedly propagating, Jill was out of control.

00:19:08.810 --> 00:19:12.110
To minimize the danger of the nanomachines, the research institute was destroyed.

00:19:12.110 --> 00:19:14.910
All research on the Ai-System was halted.

00:19:14.920 --> 00:19:18.680
But Professor Kisaragi, returning to Japan,
had not given up.

00:19:19.290 --> 00:19:21.620
When his only daughter was involved in a fatal accident...

00:19:21.620 --> 00:19:25.850
What he heard, was it a message from God?
Or the murmur of the devil?

00:19:26.330 --> 00:19:29.490
Whichever it was, he had crossed
into the realm of humanity.

00:19:30.160 --> 00:19:33.860
His beloved daughter's cells were
transferred into the Ai-System.

00:19:33.870 --> 00:19:37.560
Honey's cells were revived in the nanomachines.
Imagination...

00:19:37.570 --> 00:19:41.060
By using the power of imagination as
a source, her life was sustained.

00:19:41.210 --> 00:19:43.800
She was given the ability to surpass humans.

00:19:43.940 --> 00:19:45.740
That is Cutie Honey.

00:19:45.750 --> 00:19:49.150
You possess something that Jill-sama needs.

00:19:49.150 --> 00:19:51.910
And now, you are to serve Jill-sama.

00:19:51.920 --> 00:19:53.350
Come!

00:19:53.350 --> 00:19:57.810
Both you and I are part of Jill-sama.
And now we will become one.

00:19:57.820 --> 00:20:00.880
That is my true wish.

00:20:01.130 --> 00:20:03.960
You're lying... It's all a lie!

00:20:03.960 --> 00:20:06.930
It's not a lie. Now come, Honey!

00:20:08.900 --> 00:20:11.700
She has the self control of a human heart.

00:20:11.710 --> 00:20:14.540
For the first time, the Ai-System took on a perspective of humanity.

00:20:14.540 --> 00:20:16.510
Honey has proven this.

00:20:16.640 --> 00:20:20.270
And now that Prototype Jill, once reported dead,
has become active once again...

00:20:20.280 --> 00:20:23.770
Only she... Only Honey can stop Jill.

00:20:24.120 --> 00:20:25.740
Please believe in her.

00:20:26.220 --> 00:20:28.920
You must be so confused. Perhaps I've overloaded you.

00:20:28.920 --> 00:20:31.790
I guess you really are a machine after all.

00:20:31.790 --> 00:20:35.690
No, Honey! Don't listen to that phony's story!
Don't be fooled!

00:20:40.130 --> 00:20:43.400
— Na-chan!
— I wish you would stay out of this.

00:20:43.400 --> 00:20:45.890
Jill-sama and Honey-sama are sisters.

00:20:45.910 --> 00:20:50.210
It isn't right for the two of them to be apart.
Don't you agree?

00:20:50.210 --> 00:20:53.040
I don't have time for your false cordiality.

00:20:53.050 --> 00:20:55.610
Well, perhaps you'll excuse us then.

00:20:55.620 --> 00:20:56.950
I'm not leaving by myself.

00:20:56.950 --> 00:20:59.850
I would appreciate it if you wouldn't be so selfish!

00:21:01.050 --> 00:21:05.460
Honey, what are you doing?
Jill... Finish Jill off!

00:21:06.660 --> 00:21:09.060
Your discomfort will soon be at an end.

00:21:09.060 --> 00:21:12.590
Please enjoy the pleasures of eternity.

00:21:12.600 --> 00:21:14.730
I'm not quite ready to die.

00:21:14.740 --> 00:21:18.190
No, this is the start of a beautiful new world.

00:21:18.640 --> 00:21:19.970
Na-chan!

00:21:25.610 --> 00:21:26.870
What?!

00:21:26.880 --> 00:21:29.850
You promised me! Don't forget!

00:21:29.850 --> 00:21:32.110
Honey!!

00:21:41.330 --> 00:21:42.490
Honey...

00:21:51.340 --> 00:21:55.370
Come. Our origins are one.

00:22:03.080 --> 00:22:04.980
Code 901 confirmed.

00:22:05.020 --> 00:22:07.610
We're proceeding to Scenario D-5 as planned.

00:22:07.620 --> 00:22:11.180
Commander!
It's too soon to use a nuclear weapon in Tokyo!

00:22:11.190 --> 00:22:13.520
As long as Honey's alive, there's still hope!

00:22:13.530 --> 00:22:18.230
— You knew?
— With the way you guys operate, it's not hard to guess.

00:22:18.700 --> 00:22:20.500
Ah, I see...

00:22:20.500 --> 00:22:23.200
Thank you for speaking so frankly with us, Agent Blue.

00:22:23.200 --> 00:22:26.000
Target position confirmed.
I'm bringing it up on the monitor.

00:22:26.640 --> 00:22:30.010
Looks like that hope you were
talking about has fallen through.

00:22:30.010 --> 00:22:31.710
What a shame.

00:22:41.960 --> 00:22:42.890
Honey...

00:22:45.630 --> 00:22:47.590
That kind of backfired...

00:22:50.330 --> 00:22:53.490
Yet I still have an ace up my sleeve.

00:23:00.470 --> 00:23:02.940
We will finally become one.

00:23:04.340 --> 00:23:07.250
Show me what's in your heart.

00:23:08.010 --> 00:23:10.810
Why... why do you close your heart to me?

00:23:11.620 --> 00:23:15.650
Why? Open yourself to me and show me everything!

00:23:20.360 --> 00:23:22.330
— So this is everything?
— Yep.

00:23:22.330 --> 00:23:25.820
Everything we confiscated from the terrorists, was left here. Sort of a farewell present.

00:23:25.830 --> 00:23:28.430
Sorry to trouble you. But why?

00:23:28.440 --> 00:23:32.430
When you get to be my age, you get good at reading a girl's face

00:23:32.440 --> 00:23:35.430
I understand what you're thinking.

00:23:35.440 --> 00:23:38.470
I'm not a girl any more.
How about ex-girls?

00:23:38.610 --> 00:23:40.710
By the way, is it just the two of you here?

00:23:40.710 --> 00:23:44.620
The rest of those heroes said they were going to plan a counter-attack but ran off before it happened.

00:23:44.620 --> 00:23:48.150
And there's a rumor floating around that the US army may be launching a nuclear strike.

00:23:48.160 --> 00:23:49.050
Jesus...

00:23:49.060 --> 00:23:52.460
But there are still a few of us with some spirit down here.

00:23:52.460 --> 00:23:55.660
But Detective, will you be all right by yourself?

00:23:55.660 --> 00:23:58.530
I'm not a Detective any more. Just plain old Aki Natsuko.

00:23:58.530 --> 00:24:00.120
Aki... Natsuko.

00:24:00.270 --> 00:24:02.670
From here on out, it's a personal battle.

00:24:02.670 --> 00:24:04.300
A battle?

00:24:04.300 --> 00:24:07.140
Something very important was taken from me.
I have to take it back.

00:24:07.140 --> 00:24:09.730
That girl...
You're talking about Honey, right?

00:24:09.740 --> 00:24:12.140
But isn't she dead?

00:24:12.150 --> 00:24:14.940
No. She's alive.

00:24:15.020 --> 00:24:16.540
How do you know?

00:24:16.550 --> 00:24:18.580
— Intuition.
— That's not much to go on...

00:24:18.590 --> 00:24:21.610
How little you know.
A woman's intuition never fails.

00:24:21.620 --> 00:24:25.320
Give it all you've got! I trust your instincts.

00:24:25.330 --> 00:24:29.590
Well, I leave Japan's safety in your hands.

00:24:29.600 --> 00:24:32.360
Take care of things,
Tokimura-san... Mikami-kun...

00:24:33.570 --> 00:24:34.970
Detective...

00:24:36.900 --> 00:24:39.430
Current depth, 20.
Maintaining firing depth.

00:24:39.440 --> 00:24:41.300
Position reached.
Awaiting firing orders.

00:24:41.310 --> 00:24:43.900
— Launch pad, pressure clear.
— Target data input complete.

00:24:43.910 --> 00:24:46.040
Gyro stability in...

00:24:49.980 --> 00:24:53.610
Hello? This is Double OK speaking.

00:24:54.090 --> 00:24:57.420
Show me your heart...

00:25:05.830 --> 00:25:08.930
I see... So that's it.

00:25:09.770 --> 00:25:12.800
When you began to interact with
other beings other than yourself,

00:25:12.810 --> 00:25:15.240
that which you call emotion was born.

00:25:15.240 --> 00:25:19.240
You felt confusion, sadness, and pain.

00:25:19.250 --> 00:25:20.580
Now I understand.

00:25:20.610 --> 00:25:22.450
We must become one.

00:25:22.620 --> 00:25:27.050
Disturbance of the heart and arousal of emotion
are due to the existence of other beings.

00:25:27.150 --> 00:25:29.310
Everyone should become me.

00:25:29.320 --> 00:25:32.090
Everything should become one with me!

00:25:32.090 --> 00:25:35.030
This is what that person was talking about.

00:25:35.030 --> 00:25:38.900
Make the world into one and hold it in the palm of your hand...

00:25:38.900 --> 00:25:40.490
I finally understand!

00:25:46.940 --> 00:25:48.770
Minato, Tokyo Shiba Park area

00:25:48.940 --> 00:25:50.400
Off the Coast of Miura Peninsula

00:25:50.410 --> 00:25:51.610
What is this light?!

00:25:51.650 --> 00:25:53.360
Fields of Kantou

00:25:53.650 --> 00:25:56.030
Earth

00:25:57.950 --> 00:26:00.120
New York

00:26:00.370 --> 00:26:02.120
Paris

00:26:02.290 --> 00:26:03.870
London

00:26:03.950 --> 00:26:05.460
Moscow

00:26:12.170 --> 00:26:14.420
Inside the Jill Tree Throne Room

00:26:14.630 --> 00:26:16.720
Butler

00:26:16.840 --> 00:26:18.890
US Navy 7th Fleet, George W. Bush

00:26:21.710 --> 00:26:23.770
Yes, sir. As you command.

00:26:27.780 --> 00:26:30.380
So to what do I owe this pleasure?

00:26:30.380 --> 00:26:33.440
This isn't execution, is it?

00:26:33.550 --> 00:26:35.710
We want you to continue your work.

00:26:35.720 --> 00:26:36.650
Huh?

00:26:36.660 --> 00:26:38.920
Urgent orders from above.

00:26:39.090 --> 00:26:40.150
I see.

00:26:41.570 --> 00:26:41.860
Washington D.C.

00:26:41.860 --> 00:26:42.930
Yes, ma'am!

00:26:42.930 --> 00:26:43.910
As you requested, I've sent notification.

00:26:43.910 --> 00:26:46.370
The White House

00:26:47.040 --> 00:26:47.100
Oval Office

00:26:47.100 --> 00:26:49.570
Mr. President, what was that about?

00:26:49.570 --> 00:26:53.970
It was the legendary agent from World War ll.

00:26:54.170 --> 00:26:55.760
Minato, Tokyo Takeshiba Pier Warehouse 9

00:26:56.540 --> 00:26:57.700
Granny.

00:26:58.010 --> 00:27:01.040
It's gonna get dangerous around here.
You better get out of here.

00:27:01.050 --> 00:27:04.110
Perfect timing!
My preparations are finished, too.

00:27:04.850 --> 00:27:08.790
Here! Onigiri, onigiri!
I'm sure she's gotten hungry waiting for you.

00:27:08.790 --> 00:27:10.310
You're probably right.

00:27:12.430 --> 00:27:13.950
What's this??

00:27:16.300 --> 00:27:17.890
Who the hell's calling at a time like this?

00:27:17.900 --> 00:27:20.060
I believe someone called for a taxi?

00:27:20.730 --> 00:27:23.460
— You?!
— That's right, it's me!

00:27:23.470 --> 00:27:24.960
Hi!

00:27:24.970 --> 00:27:28.600
Just in time!
I hate to impose, but how about giving me a ride?

00:27:28.610 --> 00:27:31.240
How can I refuse, Na-chan?

00:27:35.080 --> 00:27:39.140
— Granny, get to a safe place.
— I'm staying at home.

00:27:44.090 --> 00:27:47.220
Well, see you later.
Take care of yourself.

00:27:52.330 --> 00:27:53.590
Honey!

00:27:54.830 --> 00:27:56.670
Open your eyes, Honey!

00:27:57.700 --> 00:27:59.540
Can you hear me? Honey!

00:27:59.740 --> 00:28:02.000
Move in, as close as you can.

00:28:02.010 --> 00:28:04.030
I think that's a little dangerous...

00:28:04.040 --> 00:28:07.410
— You're a man, aren't you? Stop whining!
— Well, if you're that set on it...

00:28:08.850 --> 00:28:10.910
Honey! Honey!

00:28:11.180 --> 00:28:12.550
Honey!

00:28:14.690 --> 00:28:15.920
Na-chan.

00:28:16.590 --> 00:28:19.620
Why? Why are you leaving me?

00:28:21.430 --> 00:28:23.900
Let go... Na-chan is...

00:28:23.900 --> 00:28:25.060
Why?

00:28:25.070 --> 00:28:28.870
Why do you go to her?
Why her and not me?

00:28:29.100 --> 00:28:32.090
I will not forgive this.
We had finally become one!

00:28:32.210 --> 00:28:35.300
You... are mine!!

00:28:41.950 --> 00:28:44.080
Why is that thing changing?

00:28:44.080 --> 00:28:46.080
I don't know how
I'm supposed to answer that...

00:28:52.290 --> 00:28:54.060
At this rate we won't get any closer.

00:28:54.060 --> 00:28:56.120
Well, we're uninvited guests, you know.

00:28:56.130 --> 00:28:59.190
— We have no choice but to go straight in!
— You sure there's no other way?

00:28:59.200 --> 00:29:03.030
Grow some balls, will ya?!
Agents aren't complete cowards, are they?

00:29:03.040 --> 00:29:06.700
— Oh, you figured out my secret?
— Don't underestimate an ex-public safety officer!

00:29:06.710 --> 00:29:09.110
That's my Na-chan.
Okay let's go!

00:29:10.310 --> 00:29:13.610
Hang on tight!!

00:29:26.230 --> 00:29:29.820
— It won't let us through.
— Guess it won't be that easy.

00:29:29.830 --> 00:29:31.820
Get closer to the back of its neck.

00:29:31.830 --> 00:29:33.090
Okay!

00:29:38.040 --> 00:29:40.130
Damn! I guess this is
what has to happen!

00:29:45.210 --> 00:29:47.840
Natsuko!!

00:29:49.680 --> 00:29:51.810
I'm getting dizzy!

00:30:04.760 --> 00:30:06.390
Nice recovery!

00:30:07.800 --> 00:30:09.360
Hang on, Honey!

00:30:19.350 --> 00:30:23.110
Wow, nice going!
I'm not doing too bad myself.

00:30:28.820 --> 00:30:31.520
Natsuko Flash!

00:30:40.770 --> 00:30:41.930
Honey!

00:30:43.440 --> 00:30:45.460
You did it, Na-chan!

00:30:49.240 --> 00:30:50.640
That idiot!

00:30:57.350 --> 00:30:59.910
Damn you!

00:31:03.260 --> 00:31:05.160
Anti-nanomachines, huh?

00:31:06.060 --> 00:31:07.720
Nice going, Na-chan!

00:31:07.730 --> 00:31:11.160
Now how about accepting my feelings for you?

00:31:13.600 --> 00:31:15.000
What's this?

00:31:15.000 --> 00:31:18.160
To put it difficultly,
it's a nano-restart program solution.

00:31:18.170 --> 00:31:20.110
Huh? W-What's that?

00:31:20.110 --> 00:31:24.200
More simply, it's medicine to wake a sleeping princess.

00:31:27.810 --> 00:31:29.080
Hayami-kun.

00:31:39.090 --> 00:31:40.150
Na-chan!

00:31:40.260 --> 00:31:42.090
I can hear Na-chan's voice!

00:31:42.100 --> 00:31:43.460
Why?

00:31:43.460 --> 00:31:46.060
Why do you choose that person over me?

00:31:46.070 --> 00:31:48.090
Honey flash! Honey flash!!

00:31:48.100 --> 00:31:49.690
Honey flash!!!

00:31:49.700 --> 00:31:52.600
Please, Honey... Open your eyes!

00:31:52.610 --> 00:31:55.600
Because Na-chan is my friend...

00:31:55.810 --> 00:31:58.500
Rid yourself of things such as that.

00:31:58.510 --> 00:32:02.380
You have me.
You and I are one!

00:32:03.650 --> 00:32:04.880
Please...

00:32:07.150 --> 00:32:10.780
Come on, I'm begging you! Drink it!

00:32:17.460 --> 00:32:19.860
I have... no other choice.

00:32:24.570 --> 00:32:25.940
Na-chan!

00:32:28.880 --> 00:32:31.310
Stop! Don't go!

00:32:34.250 --> 00:32:36.680
Why do you go with another?

00:32:36.680 --> 00:32:39.170
It will just cause you more pain!

00:32:39.420 --> 00:32:42.180
Don't leave me alone!

00:32:43.160 --> 00:32:46.420
Please, Honey... Answer me.

00:32:48.590 --> 00:32:49.890
Na-chan...

00:32:57.400 --> 00:32:59.000
H-Honey.

00:33:03.280 --> 00:33:05.370
Sometimes I'm a magnificent sword fighter.

00:33:05.850 --> 00:33:08.180
Other times I'm a sleeping beauty.

00:33:08.180 --> 00:33:11.380
Calling herself a beauty... she's so cool.

00:33:11.380 --> 00:33:15.480
However, my real identify is...
Aki Natsuko's inseparable partner...

00:33:15.490 --> 00:33:19.120
Warrior of Love, Cutie Honey!

00:33:19.130 --> 00:33:20.020
Honey.

00:33:20.030 --> 00:33:22.890
Thank you, Na-chan.
I could hear you.

00:33:24.630 --> 00:33:26.100
You'll be okay, Na-chan!

00:33:26.100 --> 00:33:28.330
Hey, where are you running?

00:33:28.330 --> 00:33:31.360
Not to worry! With these boots I can run anywhere!

00:33:31.370 --> 00:33:33.840
We're going to raid Jill's place now!

00:33:34.840 --> 00:33:38.140
Looks like you can't do without this.

00:33:38.440 --> 00:33:42.210
Here. You'll eat this, won't you?
Granny's hand-made onigiri.

00:33:42.650 --> 00:33:43.580
Yeah!

00:33:48.090 --> 00:33:50.520
It's one incredible thing after another!

00:33:50.520 --> 00:33:55.260
Just what you'd expect from Detective Aki Natsuko.
She's putting on a bigger show than I thought.

00:34:01.230 --> 00:34:03.030
What's this?

00:34:03.040 --> 00:34:05.470
It's come as far as the throne room...

00:34:05.470 --> 00:34:07.170
No cause for panic.

00:34:07.210 --> 00:34:11.540
Even if we do nothing, that girl will come back on her own.

00:34:11.540 --> 00:34:14.570
She will return and save us the trouble.

00:34:14.580 --> 00:34:15.710
As you say.

00:34:24.660 --> 00:34:27.460
I'm back, as you wished, Sister Jill.

00:34:27.460 --> 00:34:29.190
Welcome back, Honey.

00:34:29.300 --> 00:34:33.250
I'd like to ask that you not trouble
Jill-sama and myself any further.

00:34:33.270 --> 00:34:35.960
I am the precise image of Professor Kisaragi,

00:34:35.970 --> 00:34:39.960
and if you do not oppose me, we can be together forever.

00:34:39.970 --> 00:34:42.810
Now, return to us once more.

00:34:42.810 --> 00:34:46.180
Honey, don't be fooled.
Leave him to me.

00:34:46.180 --> 00:34:48.110
Stop, Na-chan.

00:34:48.110 --> 00:34:49.980
Honey, you...!

00:34:50.350 --> 00:34:52.040
You're such a good girl.

00:34:59.690 --> 00:35:01.280
What are you doing?!

00:35:02.760 --> 00:35:05.630
W-Why... I'm...

00:35:05.930 --> 00:35:09.770
In the end, you're nothing more than a
shadow assuming the form of my father.

00:35:09.770 --> 00:35:12.740
I guess you really are a machine after all.

00:35:12.740 --> 00:35:16.230
My father told me to live on as a human.

00:35:16.410 --> 00:35:18.740
He wouldn't call me a machine.

00:35:19.450 --> 00:35:22.070
Yes, I suppose you're right.

00:35:25.080 --> 00:35:27.350
Goodbye, father...

00:35:27.550 --> 00:35:30.390
Knowing it was a shadow, you still shed tears...

00:35:30.820 --> 00:35:33.490
What an inconvenient thing, this emotion.

00:35:33.490 --> 00:35:36.020
If you depend on others, you will end up being hurt.

00:35:36.030 --> 00:35:37.720
Why don't you understand that?

00:35:37.730 --> 00:35:39.960
What about you?
Why do you pretend to be so strong?

00:35:39.970 --> 00:35:43.830
— What?!
— I am you. You are me.

00:35:43.840 --> 00:35:45.430
I understand.

00:35:45.440 --> 00:35:48.430
Just what do you,
who tossed me aside, understand?

00:35:48.440 --> 00:35:51.240
You should know.
You have emotion, too!

00:35:51.240 --> 00:35:54.080
Your heart is growing even now.

00:35:54.450 --> 00:35:56.110
I am...

00:35:56.520 --> 00:35:58.280
me!

00:36:06.230 --> 00:36:07.320
Honey!

00:36:07.330 --> 00:36:08.790
It's okay, Na-chan.

00:36:09.900 --> 00:36:12.190
Leave this girl to me.

00:36:12.370 --> 00:36:16.960
It was your loneliness... that created
that man who took the form of father.

00:36:17.100 --> 00:36:18.430
That's right, isn't it?

00:36:21.910 --> 00:36:23.340
What is this?!

00:36:26.450 --> 00:36:29.740
It was lonely, wasn't it?
By yourself for so long...

00:36:29.850 --> 00:36:31.780
It was painful, wasn't it?

00:36:32.320 --> 00:36:35.150
Stop that, you wretch!

00:36:47.770 --> 00:36:49.290
Don't come any closer!

00:36:50.070 --> 00:36:52.870
Stop! Stop!! Stop!!!

00:36:57.540 --> 00:37:00.100
Stop!!!

00:37:16.700 --> 00:37:19.060
You're not alone any more.

00:37:19.670 --> 00:37:23.730
You'll become me.
You won't be alone any more.

00:37:24.170 --> 00:37:27.900
Inside you,
I won't be lonely any more...

00:37:28.610 --> 00:37:31.410
That's right. You are me.

00:37:31.580 --> 00:37:34.270
And I will become you.

00:37:35.150 --> 00:37:36.550
This light...

00:37:37.250 --> 00:37:39.220
What's happening?

00:37:40.620 --> 00:37:43.050
What is this feeling...?

00:37:44.690 --> 00:37:46.160
No!

00:37:46.690 --> 00:37:51.360
Being alone is awful.
But no longer existing as myself,

00:37:51.360 --> 00:37:53.630
More than being alone,
is something I absolutely cannot live with!

00:37:55.200 --> 00:37:57.070
No! It's not like that!

00:37:57.070 --> 00:38:01.400
If I will no longer exist as myself...
I choose death for myself!

00:38:03.740 --> 00:38:08.870
That is...
I will exist as Sister Jill!

00:38:11.780 --> 00:38:14.380
The Seahawk's code 901 has been restarted!

00:38:14.390 --> 00:38:16.380
Target coordinates locked!

00:38:16.390 --> 00:38:18.820
The SL beam has gone into launch mode!

00:38:18.820 --> 00:38:21.590
That's impossible! We haven't issued any orders to attack!

00:38:21.590 --> 00:38:24.860
The Seahawk's control system...
The launch circuits are being set off!

00:38:27.300 --> 00:38:28.900
Launch countdown proceeding.

00:38:28.900 --> 00:38:31.400
Stop it! Whatever you have
to do, just stop it!

00:38:31.400 --> 00:38:34.540
It's not working! Control systems and command codes
are all being rejected!

00:38:34.540 --> 00:38:36.600
Override commands aren't being accepted!

00:38:36.610 --> 00:38:39.170
The emergency shutdown system has no power!

00:38:39.180 --> 00:38:41.940
We have no control!

00:38:42.520 --> 00:38:44.280
What's going on?

00:38:48.090 --> 00:38:49.850
What are you trying to do?

00:38:49.860 --> 00:38:53.090
I already told you. While I'm still myself,

00:38:53.090 --> 00:38:55.490
I choose death.

00:38:55.490 --> 00:38:57.520
Why? Let's live on together!

00:38:57.530 --> 00:39:01.230
That window has closed. You and I are different.

00:39:01.230 --> 00:39:03.830
We're not different! Why won't you understand that?!

00:39:03.840 --> 00:39:06.270
I am me, Sister Jill!

00:39:06.270 --> 00:39:07.800
I am not you!

00:39:12.810 --> 00:39:15.370
When I die, so will you.

00:39:15.510 --> 00:39:18.810
Oh boy, I shouldn't have become friends with you after all.

00:39:18.820 --> 00:39:19.940
Na-chan!

00:39:20.420 --> 00:39:22.720
I'm kidding, it was just a joke!

00:39:23.020 --> 00:39:24.350
Onigiri.

00:39:24.790 --> 00:39:26.310
Do you still have some?

00:39:27.930 --> 00:39:30.760
Oh, I think it's here, but...

00:39:30.760 --> 00:39:32.090
This is it.

00:39:32.100 --> 00:39:35.690
— Toss it over.
— Well, I guess this will be your last meal.

00:39:36.600 --> 00:39:38.260
No it won't.

00:39:39.440 --> 00:39:40.630
Not a chance.

00:39:41.040 --> 00:39:43.240
Na-chan, you go on ahead.

00:39:46.510 --> 00:39:50.950
I never thought this would be the last
time I would see the Detective.

00:39:50.950 --> 00:39:52.820
Heh. Me neither.

00:39:55.320 --> 00:39:57.020
What the hell is that thing?

00:39:57.360 --> 00:39:59.880
So it went up after all...

00:40:00.430 --> 00:40:03.830
Where exactly am I supposed to go?
A nuclear missile is headed this way!

00:40:03.960 --> 00:40:05.590
There's no point in running.

00:40:05.600 --> 00:40:09.590
That's true, but I'll try to do something. So go on...

00:40:09.600 --> 00:40:11.930
Something?
What do you think you're gonna do?

00:40:11.940 --> 00:40:14.340
I have no idea, and I'm not sure there's anything I can do.

00:40:14.340 --> 00:40:17.000
Then I'm not going anywhere.
Let me stay.

00:40:17.010 --> 00:40:19.000
I don't want to be separated from you.

00:40:23.020 --> 00:40:24.240
But...

00:40:24.250 --> 00:40:27.310
But if you're here, it's hard for me
to really let myself go.

00:40:27.320 --> 00:40:28.510
What do you mean?

00:40:28.520 --> 00:40:33.550
If the Ai-System gets pushed to the limit,
then... then... the missile....

00:40:33.730 --> 00:40:38.100
Well, I'm sure I'll make it back to your place,
so go ahead, okay?

00:40:44.000 --> 00:40:46.200
Don't forget... your promise.

00:40:47.210 --> 00:40:48.230
Okay...

00:40:48.240 --> 00:40:50.230
Tell me, "Yes, ma'am!"

00:40:50.240 --> 00:40:51.500
Yes, ma'am.

00:40:53.110 --> 00:40:54.340
Okay then.

00:40:55.350 --> 00:40:57.370
Wait for me, Na-chan.

00:41:07.990 --> 00:41:11.050
It's too late.

00:41:11.160 --> 00:41:14.830
We'll see.
I won't know unless I try, right?

00:41:17.070 --> 00:41:20.900
Honey Flash!

00:41:31.380 --> 00:41:34.180
Lieutenant...!

00:41:34.890 --> 00:41:38.820
A new energy reaction has been detected at the center of the explosion!

00:41:39.730 --> 00:41:40.820
Another missile?

00:41:40.830 --> 00:41:43.090
No, sir! The thermal reading doesn't match!

00:41:43.100 --> 00:41:45.290
— The blast is reversing!
— Explosion temperature dropping!

00:41:45.300 --> 00:41:49.100
— Everything is receding! The radiation...
— The core is collapsing!

00:42:04.650 --> 00:42:07.080
I... I'm...

00:42:27.570 --> 00:42:30.940
— What the hell...
— Happened?

00:42:36.780 --> 00:42:38.150
What's going on?

00:42:38.220 --> 00:42:39.840
What's going on?!

00:42:40.720 --> 00:42:42.380
Terada-kun!

00:42:45.220 --> 00:42:49.350
What in the name of god is going on?!

00:42:49.460 --> 00:42:53.260
This must be the miracle of the Ai-System, eh?

00:42:53.270 --> 00:42:54.760
I guess so.

00:42:54.770 --> 00:43:00.570
This is just a rumor, but... they say there's still a legendary agent around since the days of WW2.

00:43:00.840 --> 00:43:02.500
That's a nice broom.

00:43:02.510 --> 00:43:05.200
I bet it's cleaned up lots of things over the years.

00:43:05.210 --> 00:43:07.610
Well, cleaning is my job.

00:43:07.610 --> 00:43:08.980
Sweeper.

00:43:08.980 --> 00:43:12.180
Apparently that's what this agent was called...

00:43:22.830 --> 00:43:25.730
Stars in the sky.
Flowers on the earth.

00:43:26.400 --> 00:43:28.160
Love to human beings.

00:43:30.040 --> 00:43:33.130
Warrior of love, Cutie Honey!

00:43:48.090 --> 00:43:49.150
Hello?

00:43:49.150 --> 00:43:51.490
I have a job for you.
Can you help me?

00:43:51.560 --> 00:43:51.620
Aki Detective Agency

00:43:51.620 --> 00:43:54.720
I'm afraid there will be an extra fee assessed without a written request.

00:43:54.720 --> 00:43:54.770
Aki Detective Agency

00:43:54.960 --> 00:43:58.400
Nobody can handle this but you two.
I'm counting on you!

00:44:01.670 --> 00:44:03.930
— We've got a job.
— Okay!

00:44:06.870 --> 00:44:07.860
Here ya go.

00:44:10.680 --> 00:44:12.270
Thanks, Granny!

00:44:12.280 --> 00:44:13.240
My pleasure.

00:44:13.250 --> 00:44:15.270
Honey, what's the hold up?

00:44:15.280 --> 00:44:16.980
Come on, let's go!

00:44:16.980 --> 00:44:19.250
Okay, Na-chan!

00:44:19.250 --> 00:44:22.520
That's "Yes, ma'am!".
How many times do I have to tell you?

00:44:23.720 --> 00:44:25.020
Yes, ma'am!

00:44:48.410 --> 00:44:51.540
The girls in fashion these days,
Kono goro hayari no onna no ko

00:44:51.550 --> 00:44:54.640
Are the girls with small butts.
Oshiri no chiisana onna no ko

00:44:54.650 --> 00:44:57.820
Turn this way, Honey!
Kocchi wo muite yo hanii

00:44:57.820 --> 00:45:01.950
But somehow... But, but, it's a little bit...
Datte nanda ka datte datte nanda mon

00:45:03.600 --> 00:45:09.760
Please! Please! Don't hurt me.
Onegai! Onegai! Kizutsuke naide

00:45:09.770 --> 00:45:13.300
My heart is...
Watashi no haato wa

00:45:13.310 --> 00:45:16.640
Oh no, it's pounding!
Chuku chuku shichau no

00:45:16.640 --> 00:45:21.080
Please don't stare, please!
Iya yo, iya yo, iya yo mitsumecha iyaa

00:45:21.710 --> 00:45:24.080
Honey Flash!

00:45:34.790 --> 00:45:38.060
The popular girls these days,
Imadoki ninki no onna no ko

00:45:38.060 --> 00:45:41.120
Are bouncy and buxom girls.
Pukutto boin no onna no ko

00:45:41.130 --> 00:45:44.230
Turn this way, Honey!
Kocchi wo muite yo hanni

00:45:44.240 --> 00:45:48.670
But somehow... But, but, it's a little bit...
Datte nanda ka datte datte nanda mon

00:45:50.040 --> 00:45:56.170
Please! Please! Don't come near!
Onegai! Onegai! Chikayora naide

00:45:56.180 --> 00:45:59.740
My nose...
Watashi no ohana ga

00:45:59.790 --> 00:46:03.050
Oh, no! It's twitching!
Hiku Hiku shichau no

00:46:03.060 --> 00:46:07.520
Please don't stare, please!
Iya yo, iya yo, iya yo mitsumecha iyaa

00:46:08.130 --> 00:46:10.490
Honey Flash!

00:46:12.560 --> 00:46:13.750
It's over!
